add('Pipeline orchestration and calibration selection', [36,59,65,66,67,68,69,70,71,122,499,527,528], 'Different task systems repeatedly manage dependencies, files and execution.', 'One task graph, artifact catalogue and cache mechanism; retain domain recipes.', 'A generic scheduler does not replace instrument calibration rules or scientific data-quality gates.')
