add('Timing, period searches and stochastic signals', [1,85,93,94,136,139,140,141,320,395,468], 'Related signal-analysis primitives with domain-specific timing models.', 'Common time-series, Fourier, windowing, period-search and covariance operations.', 'Pulsar barycentric timing is more than a periodogram; irregular sampling, exposure and noise models differ.')
